WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:05.438
NARRATOR: In the
south, a 14-ton bread

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:09.075
truck is impaled on rocks.

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.810
Thord and Andrzej
were attempting

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:15.014
to lift it clear until it
threatened to crash back

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:18.418
down with Thord underneath.

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:20.854
[bleep] that bloody
left bar right there.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.458
[tools clanging]

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:30.096
You know, we have to be
careful here because this

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:31.498
is nothing to be kidding with.

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:39.873
THORD: We're putting them
here under the wheel.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:43.042
So if something happened it
will not go so long down,

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:44.444
so there is space for us.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.246
We always take the safe first.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.522
[truck idling]

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.567
NARRATOR: Andrzej
brings in a heavy duty

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:10.870
airbag capable of
lifting 30 tons

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.640
to bolster the trolley jacks.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:17.310
Using an electric compressor,
he has to inflate it quickly

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:20.980
to stabilize the truck.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:22.816
[airbag inflating]

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:44.304
NARRATOR: With everyone
clear they try again

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.974
to haul out the huge rocks.

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:50.543
[mechanical whirring]

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:57.517
[intense music playing]

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:02.856
[rock slamming]

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.092
Woohoo!

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:07.660
[truck idling]

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:14.067
[hopeful music playing]

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:16.369
[mechanical whirring]

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:18.938
NARRATOR: Because the airbag
holds up the bread truck,

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:21.841
it should be a piece of cake
to pull out the last few rocks.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.048
THORD: Now we have
taken some very

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:34.587
big stones away under the
truck, so now we are very happy.

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:35.922
[laughter]

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.190
[boisterous yell]

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:39.225
NARRATOR: But this job
is only half-baked.

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:44.631
The bread truck is still stuck.

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:48.401
Thord and Andrzej now have
to winch it up onto the road.

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:54.307
Take it out from this place,
go for the garage, and repair.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:56.409
[truck idling]

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.516
NARRATOR: Inching it
forward on wooden tracks,

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:07.687
Thord must not let
the truck slip.

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:10.123
[creaking noises]

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:26.806
The road's still open, so Thord
must avoid holding up traffic.

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.614
[intense music playing]

00:03:37.216 --> 00:03:42.221
THORD: My plan is always
working and this time too.

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:44.791
We can work in dream team.

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:45.725
[laughter]

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.562
Today is the best
people working together.

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:53.866
So now Andrzej go to garage and
then, maybe Monday, it repair.

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:56.936
Then he can drive a new
trip with the bread then.

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:58.004
[inaudible]

